      "writtenOn": "2024-11-15T17:03:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The next patch sets a timer interrupt. However, if `STM32_USART_CR2_RTOEN` is not enabled, this data is stuck until the producer fills a packet, so this also needs to be within the same `#ifdef STM32_USART_CR2_RTOEN`.\n\nBased on that, I would change `STM32_USART_CR2_RTOEN` to something more descriptive of the feature itself, like `USB_BUFFER_TX_DATA_ENABLED`.",
      "parentUuid": "24e2f6ad_bc74f37c",
