      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another reason why this handling in usb-stream.c should not be compile-time dependent on UART capabilities is that I may want to merge the below patch independently of the UART driver enhancements.  That is, there are\n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/6032769",
